{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.elementSetoid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.elementSetoid","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L52-L53","doc":"The element class as the `Setoid` induced by isotope equivalence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.isoEquiv_equivalence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.isoEquiv_equivalence","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L46-L50","doc":"The manuscript's claim assembled: isotope equivalence is an\n`Equivalence`, so `{atom-knots}/∼` (the element class for `Z`) is a\nwell-defined quotient. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.isoEquiv_trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.isoEquiv_trans","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L41-L44","doc":"Isotope equivalence is transitive (manuscript \"Transitivity\"). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.isoEquiv_symm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.isoEquiv_symm","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L37-L39","doc":"Isotope equivalence is symmetric (manuscript \"Symmetry\"). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.isoEquiv_refl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.isoEquiv_refl","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L34-L35","doc":"Isotope equivalence is reflexive (manuscript \"Reflexivity\"). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.IsoEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.IsoEquiv","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L31-L32","doc":"Isotope equivalence: `K₁ ∼ K₂` iff `w(K₁) = w(K₂)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.w","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.w","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L25-L25","doc":"The proton-block invariant `w_{q^Z}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsotopeKnot","kind":"structure","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IsotopeKnot.lean#L18-L25","doc":"Isotope-equivalence data at fixed proton number `Z`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: a type `AtomKnot` of atom-knots and the\nproton-block invariant `w` into some value type `W`. Two atom-knots are\nisotope-equivalent when their invariants agree. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:isotope-knot","label":"def:isotope-knot","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/isotope-knot.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}